{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spinny Dungeon is a roguelike deckbuilder with elements of an auto battler. The full  run with one hero - Duelist - is available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were crawling through dungeons as usual. One dungeon... You saw a strange portal in the corner of the room and a huge button in front of it. You pressed that button. Then you pressed it again, and again, and again... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/extras/story6.png?t=1749147028\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demon of the Slot Machine has sent his minions to find your soul. Stop these monsters before they reach the RED ZONE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/extras/ennn.gif?t=1749147028\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build the perfect deck.</strong> Add weapons, plants, magic artifacts and companions to your deck of symbols. After each spin they will be randomly rearranged on the board.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't starve.</strong> Picking a strong companion who eats too much can be fatal not only to your enemies but also to your run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mana, gold or pure damage?</strong> It's hard to have plenty of all. So choose wisely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn new spells and upgrade the old ones.</strong> Defeating the boss at the end of the level will give you access to more powerful spells. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763910?t=1749147028","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/6343d5b2f37399f2d20efc04ad760388099bab47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749147028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/182663a4e2c4fc7139ce1060065f80f0ebbc5366/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749147028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/182663a4e2c4fc7139ce1060065f80f0ebbc5366/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749147028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spinny Dungeon is a roguelike deckbuilder with elements of an auto battler. The full  run with one hero - Duelist - is available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were crawling through dungeons as usual. One dungeon... You saw a strange portal in the corner of the room and a huge button in front of it. You pressed that button. Then you pressed it again, and again, and again... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/extras/story6.png?t=1749147028\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demon of the Slot Machine has sent his minions to find your soul. Stop these monsters before they reach the RED ZONE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763910/extras/ennn.gif?t=1749147028\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build the perfect deck.</strong> Add weapons, plants, magic artifacts and companions to your deck of symbols. After each spin they will be randomly rearranged on the board.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't starve.</strong> Picking a strong companion who eats too much can be fatal not only to your enemies but also to your run. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mana, gold or pure damage?</strong> It's hard to have 